# =============================================================================
# Construction ERP — Monorepo environment reference
# =============================================================================
#
# This repo loads env from:
#   - backend/.env   (NestJS — see backend/.env.example)
#   - frontend/.env.local (Next.js — see frontend/.env.example)
#
# Quick start (local):
#   1. cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#   2. cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env.local
#   3. docker compose up -d postgres redis minio mailpit
#   4. cd backend && npx prisma migrate dev && npx prisma db seed
#
# Production target stack:
#   - Backend  : Render (see render.yaml)
#   - Frontend : Vercel (see frontend/vercel.json — set Root Directory to "frontend")
#   - Database : Neon (PostgreSQL)
#   - Email    : Resend (SMTP)
#
# See backend/.env.example and frontend/.env.example for full variable lists.
